  "story": {
    "title": "Picture Conversations-Hygiene",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "I take bath everyday. It keeps germs away from me. Do you take bath everyday?",
      "I wash my hands before I eat. It keeps germs away from me. Do you wash your hands before you eat?",
      "I brush my teeth everyday. It keeps germs away from me. Do you brush your teeth everyday?",
      "I do not throw waste on the floor. I use the dustbin. It keeps germs away from me. Do you throw waste inside a dustbin?"
    ],
